<title>UK: Shaftesbury prices 63 mln stg debenture.</title>
<headline>Shaftesbury prices 63 mln stg debenture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following mortgage debenture stock, announced earlier by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SHAFTESBURY PLC</p>
<p> AMT   *63 MLN STG    COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    31.MAR.24</p>
<p> TYPE   DEBENTURE     ISS PRICE  103.867   PAY DATE  **25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+90 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS     1	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING SUCH STOCK TO FORM SINGLE</p>
<p>	     ISSUE OF 92 MLN STG</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 148 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
